# QA M5 flow (D-017, D-075; re-cut for D-087): game over after the
# lantern checkpoint, then continue restarts the Wolfgangsee from its start
# with the scroll reset. Title flow (play from 171). wolfgangsee_checkpoint's
# first 2169 frames: the solver route under the pontoon (checkpoint), Gelse
# #1 stings her (death 1 at 2319). Twice: respawn on the pontoon (intro,
# 60-frame hold), walk to its end, hop the bollard into the lake and float
# at the surface, pushed by the edge, until Gelse #2 stings her (deaths 2
# and 3 at 3280 and 4241). Game over at 4301; START at 4910 continues: the
# stage intro, then play at the St. Wolfgang quay (x 34, camera x 0 in the
# lead-in, 3 lives, score and Oblaten 0, the checkpoint cleared). The
# solver's notch hop then puts her on the Dampfer, her centre passes col
# 25 and the scroll starts again (x >= 400, still on the deck).
